    <string name="local_backup_scope">Save model profiles, portable appearance and agent preferences, conversations, app attachments, custom skill resources and the workspace index to a local ZIP. Stop agent tasks first.</string>
    <string name="local_backup_exclusions">The archive contains original conversations and files. Keep it private. Model keys, headers, OAuth, device permissions, execution queues and Linux systems are excluded. Workspace files require a separate backup. Limit: 256 MiB and 10,000 resource files.</string>
